-- Repair mojibake and placeholder text in model descriptions.
--
-- 1. 38 descriptions contain UTF-8 that was decoded as Latin-1 (for example
--    "hoursâ<80><94>up" instead of "hours—up"). They are re-decoded byte-for-byte;
--    no wording changes. (Three more, on Anthropic rows, are repaired in
--    20261012100000_refresh_anthropic_model_descriptions.)
-- 2. OpenAI/Google rows whose description only said "X is available through
--    OrcaRouter under the exact model ID ..." now describe the model itself
--    (dated snapshot or rolling alias of the named OpenAI model). Provider
--    availability belongs on provider routes, not in the description.

-- Guarded on the description observed during the 2026-10-12 audit, so a newer
-- admin edit is never overwritten. Row-level history is recorded by the
-- catalogue_row_history trigger on public.v2_models.
